1:// Quality bar v1 for generated textures (MASTER-PLAN 4.7 "Quality bar", GAPS-AND-IDEAS D). Automatic, deterministic
2:// checks on the RENDERED pixels of every texture Cyrus generates. A failing check is never shipped silently: the build
3:// service sends it back to the model as repair feedback (bounded), and anything still failing is dropped with a
4:// customer-visible reason (a downgrade). The same rules run in the build service (services/modbuilder/textures.js);
5:// test/cyrus-assets.test.ts proves both give identical reports on the shared fixtures. Pure and dependency-free.
